{"title":"The anti-abundance agenda?","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/920531669/0/marginalrevolution~The-antiabundance-agenda.html","date":1750486929000,"content":"<blockquote><p>It looks like a whole new shipping preference law is coming. The House overwhelmingly passed the American Cargo for American Ships Act that would require 100% of transportation project [DOT related] materials to go on US ships, driving up infrastructure costs.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/judgeglock/status/1934626413841162652\" target=\"_blank\">the Judge Glock tweet</a>, here is<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.govtrack.us/congress/bills/119/hr2035\" target=\"_blank\"> the legislation itself</a>.  Appears to be worse than the Jones Act?</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/06/the-anti-abundance-agenda.html\">The anti-abundance agenda?</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/920531669/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/920531669/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/920531669/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/920531669/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/920531669/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/920531669/marginalrevolution\"